ent-ActionHorrorMutate = Mutate
    .desc = Use devoured souls to mutate your abilities.
ent-ActionHorrorSeekSoul = Seek Soul
    .desc = Search for a soul weak enough for you to devour.
ent-ActionHorrorConsumeSoul = Devour Soul
    .desc = Devour the soul of your target from inside its head. Use it again to stop.
ent-ActionHorrorHide = Hide
    .desc = Lie low under items and tables. Toggles.
ent-ActionHorrorTrip = Trip Victim
    .desc = Trip everyone next to you with a tentacle, knocking them down for a short while.
ent-ActionHorrorTalkToCaptive = Talk to Trapped Mind
    .desc = While you drive the body, speak to the mind you locked away instead of out loud. Toggles.
ent-ActionHorrorTalkToHorror = Converse with Horror
    .desc = Think at the thing in your head instead of speaking out loud. Toggles.
ent-ActionHorrorTentacle = Grow Tentacle
    .desc = Twist your host's arm into a tentacle. Costs 50 chemicals. Use it again to turn it back.
ent-ActionHorrorTransferHost = Transfer to Another Host
    .desc = Move straight into someone next to your host. Pulling them makes it faster, but they will notice.
ent-ActionHorrorJumpstart = Revive Host
    .desc = Send a jolt through your dead host and bring it back to life. Costs 250 chemicals.
ent-ActionHorrorViewMemory = View Memories
    .desc = Read the fresh memories of your host.
ent-ActionHorrorChameleon = Chameleon Skin
    .desc = Match your skin to the surroundings. Burns 5 chemicals a tick instead of regenerating them, attacking breaks it. Toggles.
ent-ActionHorrorLubeSpill = Lube Spill
    .desc = Spin around and splash slippery lube around you. Costs 50 chemicals.
